#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
gitignore - A helper script to manage .gitignore files.

Usage:
  gitignore <pattern> [<pattern> ...]   Add pattern(s) to .gitignore
  gitignore --undo <pattern>            Remove pattern from .gitignore (files stay as they are)
  gitignore --list                      Show current .gitignore contents
  gitignore --<language>                Add a built-in pattern set (--help lists them)

To add a language, drop a templates/<flag>.gitignore into the repo and run
./build.py - the flag, the --help text and the section heading all come from it.

Install: put this file somewhere on your PATH and chmod +x it.
"""

